  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v3.2.6: Adds TorrentFileInfo.ReadUint8ArrayAsync - a zero-copy JS-typed random-access read (returns a JS Uint8Array, no .NET byte[] hop) for browser GPU upload (writeBuffer), sharing ReadFileAsync's piece selection + Critical() prioritization. Browser-only (throws PlatformNotSupportedException on desktop; use ReadFileAsync there). Foundation for zero-copy GPU model loading in SpawnDev.ILGPU.ML.",
